        <definition>double themis::CompactionManager::Stats::writeAmplification</definition>
        <argsstring>() const noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>writeAmplification</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::CompactionManager::Stats::writeAmplification</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Estimated write-amplification factor. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Defined as (compact_bytes_written + flush_bytes_written) / user_bytes_written. Returns 0.0 if no user writes have occurred. A value close to 1.0 is ideal; values above 2.0 indicate excessive compaction overhead relative to the user workload. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
